Message-ID: <CAFiYZ5xHj79ZK5RjyrGirgiQNCvtjrGPR+ObNjFBngjBrfZ6vw@mail.gmail.com>

As you can see from the error message, the data set is too large to be
handled in optmatch package, which MatchIt calls.  I'm not sure what the
problem is as the sample size appears to be modest but you might want to
subset the data so that you only retain the necessary variables you are
using for matching.  Another possibility is to reduce the data size by
first exactly matching on hhsize.

Kosuke Imai
Department of Politics
Princeton University
http://imai.princeton.edu

